(7505060, 1196143, 68504, '<td valign="top">I really like the way this works. Maybe partly because this is exactly what my sunglasses do, following recent cataract surgery, something I never thought about; now the world is silvery white with icy blue and acid yellows and greens. When it is bright.<br/> <br/>Well composed with circles that include.</td>', 'I really like the way this works. Maybe partly because this is exactly what my sunglasses do, following recent cataract surgery, something I never thought about; now the world is silvery white with icy blue and acid yellows and greens. When it is bright. Well composed with circles that include.', '2017-03-13 03:03:27.000000', NULL, 0),
