(7505470, 1196388, 3102, '<td valign="top">This shot takes me waaaaaaay back to the early days of DPC.  <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=772" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">jmsetzler</a> was pretty much unbeatable back in those days, and this was a 1st place entry of his back in June of 2002:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=2892" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/22/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_2892.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/22/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_2892.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/22/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_2892.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Nice to see a new take on a classic!</td>', 'This shot takes me waaaaaaay back to the early days of DPC.   jmsetzler was pretty much unbeatable back in those days, and this was a 1st place entry of his back in June of 2002:   Nice to see a new take on a classic!', '2017-03-16 21:47:16.000000', NULL, 0),
